description:
Data model to track individual reps within a workout session.

**Rep data structure:**
```dart
class RepRecord {
  final int repIndex;
  final DateTime timestamp;
  final bool isValid;
  final InvalidRepReason? reason;
  final Map<String, double> angles; // elbow, bodyDeviation at completion
  final List<String> framePaths; // paths to captured images
  bool userAccepted; // mutable - user can override
}
```

**Session tracking:**
- List of RepRecords for current workout
- Methods to add rep, update validity, get invalid reps
- Clear on workout reset

**Files:**
- lib/models/rep_record.dart (new)
- lib/providers/workout_manager.dart (integrate rep tracking)
